#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Creates a topogeometry object for layer denoted by "
"<varname>layer_id</varname> and registers it in the relations table in the "
"<varname>toponame</varname> schema."
msgstr ""
"Skapar ett topogeometriobjekt för det lager som betecknas med "
"<varname>layer_id</varname> och registrerar det i relationstabellen i "
"schemat <varname>toponame</varname>."

#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the first form a new TopoGeometry will be created for the given layer "
"(<varname>layer_id</varname>) of the given topology "
"(<varname>toponame</varname>)."
msgstr ""
"I den första formen skapas en ny TopoGeometry för det angivna lagret "
"(<varname>layer_id</varname>) i den angivna topologin "
"(<varname>toponame</varname>)."

#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns a <varname>topoelementarray</varname> for a set of element_id, type "
"arrays (topoelements)."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar en <varname>topoelementarray</varname> för en uppsättning arrayer"
" med element_id och typ (topoelement)."

#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns a <varname>topoelementarray</varname> (an array of topoelements) "
"containing the topological elements and type of the given TopoGeometry "
"(primitive elements)."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar en <varname>topoelementarray</varname> (en array av topoelement) "
"som innehåller de topologiska elementen och typen för den angivna "
"TopoGeometry (primitiva element)."

#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns a set of <varname>topoelement</varname> objects containing the "
"topological element_id,element_type of the given TopoGeometry (primitive "
"elements)."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar en uppsättning <varname>topoelement</varname>-objekt som "
"innehåller element_id och element_type för den angivna TopoGeometry "
"(primitiva element)."

#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns a set of element_id,element_type (topoelements) corresponding to "
"primitive topology elements <xref linkend=\"topoelement\"/> (1: nodes, 2: "
"edges, 3: faces) that a given topogeometry object in "
"<varname>toponame</varname> schema is composed of."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar en uppsättning element_id,element_type (topoelement) som "
"motsvarar de primitiva topologielementen <xref linkend=\"topoelement\"/> (1:"
" noder, 2: kanter, 3: ytor) som ett givet topogeometriobjekt i schemat "
"<varname>toponame</varname> består av."
